{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19086","headline":"奉送李户部侍郎自河南尹再除本官归阙 · 刘禹锡","name":"奉送李户部侍郎自河南尹再除本官归阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年内署振雄词，今日东都结去思。\n宫女犹传洞箫赋，国人先咏衮衣诗。\n华星却复文昌位，别鹤重归太乙池。\n想到金闺待通籍，一时惊喜见风仪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}